    description: "Adjacent finding of audit-findings 0021 (Step 5). Filed, not moved.\nelixir.yaml rows Task.async / async_stream / start / start_link / Supervisor.start_child as ipc_send (\"Task spawns -- async execution boundary\"). A spawn inside the BEAM transfers no data across the process boundary at the call; the axiom (ADR-0050 / ADR-0049 ruling 1: \"what data crosses the process boundary at this call site\") does not admit it. The spawned function's own calls are where any crossing happens.\nEffect: each Task spawn is an `ipc` taint sink and an ipc_send headline crossing. Not measured.\nFix shape (not decided): no row, or process_send if the argument closure is considered sent to the new process (erlang's spawn rows are the precedent to check first -- grep erlang.yaml for spawn before deciding)."  # 7973
    fields: {}  # 7973
- op: discuss  # f2c7
  at: '2026-10-03T15:03:56Z'  # f2c7
  by: agent  # f2c7
  actor: jgstern_agent  # f2c7
  clock: 2  # f2c7
  nonce: f2c7  # f2c7
  message: "IMPLEMENTED on branch jgstern-agent/fix/audit0021-rows (local, not pushed), commits 10f7eb148c + fdb14eb77e. Checked erlang first as asked: erlang rows spawn/spawn_link, proc_lib:spawn, supervisor:start_child as process_send, so Task.async/async_stream/start/start_link moved ipc_send -> process_send (pure relabel, ipc zone pinned). async_stream is lazy but kept (no other row carries the spawn; deleting would drop it, ADR-0049 ruling 3). FOUND: the row's \"Supervisor.start_child\" member was a function name on module Task that no call site produces (Task.Supervisor.start_child reported external_potential on dev); re-homed to module Task.Supervisor (added to CATALOGUE_SCOPE elixir). livebook: Task.Supervisor.start_child external_potential 8 -> process_send 8. CONSEQUENCE: elixir now has no ipc_send row; test_elixir_catalog_covers_all_expected_boundaries was passing on the misfiled rows and now asserts process_send; elixir's real ipc_send gap filed as WI-gurud-zuror-magiv-jobob-huvoh-jafoz-sapor-lujah. Report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_10032026/ragaz.md (OUTCOME, draft CLOSURE NOTE, A/B artifacts in run_10032026/ragaz/). Tests: red then green on the board; branch affected-test run 9955 passed + 8 failed (7 were pins of the old rows, fixed in fdb14eb77e; 1 hypothesis health-check under load), re-run of those files 1138 passed. No status change made."  # f2c7
