- op: discuss  # 7085
  at: '2026-10-03T17:05:19Z'  # 7085
  by: agent  # 7085
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 7085
  clock: 4  # 7085
  nonce: '7085'  # 7085
  message: "Merged in PR #1417 (dev c5249c1aa1).\n\nFixed on branch jgstern-agent/fix/audit0021-rows, commits 10f7eb148c and fdb14eb77e. elixir Task.async/async_stream/start/start_link are process_send, following erlang.yaml's spawn / proc_lib:spawn / supervisor:start_child precedent. The dead `Task: Supervisor.start_child` spelling is re-homed to `Task.Supervisor: start_child`.\n\nBehavioral evidence: `io-boundaries` on a one-file elixir program reports all five under process_send beside the control `:erlang.spawn`, and no ipc_send. On livebook, Task.Supervisor.start_child moved from external_potential (8) to process_send (8): before this commit the row could not match.\n\nConsequence: elixir now has no ipc_send row. The coverage test that relied on the misfiled rows asserts process_send instead, and elixir's genuine ipc_send gap (Port.command rowed subprocess; erlang:port_command unrowed) is filed as WI-gurud."  # 7085
